{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different Motorcycles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, discover different models from 10 motorcycle brands. Each with its own unique features and performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde5 Equipment and Accessories Sale:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/extras/moto-1.gif?t=1740419821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can sell not only motorcycles but also equipment such as helmets, gloves and motorcycle clothing in your store. Earn more by complementing your customers' needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Realistic Bargaining System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiate hard with customers! Make strategic offers to get the best price, but beware; customers may not give up easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 Mechanic System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase the value of your motorcycles by repairing or modifying them. Small touches can lead to big profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/extras/moto-2.gif?t=1740419821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will be a great start for those who want to step into the world of motorcycle and accessories trading!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try it now and start laying the foundations for your shop!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518450?t=1740419821","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3518450?t=1740419821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/f4ee9f6b3f6c528ee1bbdb7e0fcaf626a3dd2768/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740419821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/f4ee9f6b3f6c528ee1bbdb7e0fcaf626a3dd2768/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740419821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different Motorcycles:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version, discover different models from 10 motorcycle brands. Each with its own unique features and performance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde5 Equipment and Accessories Sale:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/extras/moto-1.gif?t=1740419821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can sell not only motorcycles but also equipment such as helmets, gloves and motorcycle clothing in your store. Earn more by complementing your customers' needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcac Realistic Bargaining System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Negotiate hard with customers! Make strategic offers to get the best price, but beware; customers may not give up easily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd27 Mechanic System:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Increase the value of your motorcycles by repairing or modifying them. Small touches can lead to big profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/extras/moto-2.gif?t=1740419821\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo will be a great start for those who want to step into the world of motorcycle and accessories trading!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Try it now and start laying the foundations for your shop!</p>","developers":["Tinker Craft Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3361620","name":"Motorcycle Sales Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3518450/header.jpg?t=